\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs24\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe255\hich\fs32\lang1033\loch\fs32\lang1033 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs32\lang1033\i0\b0 Once a character joins a guild, they cannot voluntarily leave the guild for the duration of the game.  The character will start as an \'93Initiate\'94, and then will be required to complete guild quests (unique to each guild) in order to attain higher ranks.  Each completed guild quest will advance the character\'92s guild level by 1.}
