\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs24\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe255\hich\fs32\lang1033\loch\fs32\lang1033 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs32\lang1033\i0\b0 Each level the guild member attains (after 0) in the guild also gives them the opportunity to gain a relationship level with one of two possible native groups*, as determined by the guild type.  The same native group does not need to be chosen each time.}
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs24\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe255\hich\fs24\lang1033\loch\fs24\lang1033
\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\ql\rtlch\afs24\lang255\ltrch\dbch\langfe255\hich\fs32\lang1033\loch\fs32\lang1033 {\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f0\fs32\lang1033\i0\b0 At each new level achieved, a guild member will gain benefits and access to services specific to each guild, as described below.}
